    "linkedin:c6d3474743bfd666d6064803": {
      "job": {
        "title": "Front End Engineer - Mid Level",
        "company": "Wiraa",
        "location": "",
        "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4474714966",
        "platform": "Linkedin",
        "date_posted": "",
        "is_remote": true,
        "description": "**About The Company**\n Cedar is dedicated to transforming the homeownership landscape by addressing the pressing issue of home affordability. Our innovative approach leverages technology and data\\-driven models to simplify and democratize access to home financing. With a proven track record of closing deals and scaling operations, Cedar is committed to making the dream of owning a home attainable for millions of families. Our mission is to create a seamless, transparent, and empowering experience for our customers, supported by a team of passionate professionals who are driven by impact and innovation.\n   \n\n  \n\n**About The Role**\n As a Mid\\-Level Front\\-End Engineer at Cedar, you will play a crucial role in developing and maintaining our consumer\\-facing web application. Your work will directly influence the user experience, helping families understand and navigate their homeownership options. You will own the development of key features, collaborate closely with product and design teams, and utilize cutting\\-edge AI tooling to accelerate development and improve product outcomes. This position offers an excellent opportunity for growth, ownership, and impact within a dynamic, technology\\-driven environment.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Qualifications**\n* Approximately 3\\+ years of experience building production web applications with React and TypeScript\n* Proficiency in HTML and CSS, with a strong focus on responsive design for mobile and desktop\n* Experience working with APIs, including REST and GraphQL\n* Familiarity with testing methodologies and tools integrated into development workflows\n* Interest in and enthusiasm for AI tooling and its application in software development\n* Ability to work independently and collaboratively within a cross\\-functional team\n* Strong problem\\-solving skills and attention to detail\n* Excellent communication skills and a proactive attitude\n\n\n Bonus qualifications include experience with Figma, accessibility standards (WCAG), and a good eye for design aesthetics.\n   \n\n  \n\n**Responsibilities**\n* Build and own the consumer\\-facing web application utilizing React, TypeScript, and Next.js\n* Leverage AI tooling to facilitate rapid development and contribute to its ongoing improvement\n* Validate assumptions through rigorous testing and outcome\\-based judgment of work\n* Translate complex financial logic into clear, trustworthy, and user\\-friendly UI screens\n* Collaborate closely with design and product teams from initial concept through to deployment\n* Take ownership of features from development to release, monitor usage, and iterate for enhancement\n* Maintain high standards for code quality, conduct thorough code reviews, and troubleshoot bugs at their root cause\n* Participate in daily stand\\-ups, planning, and review sessions to ensure alignment and continuous improvement\n\n\n**Benefits**\n* Comprehensive medical, dental, and vision insurance plans\n* 401(k) retirement savings plan\n* Paid time off and parental leave policies\n* Stipend for home office setup to create a productive work environment\n* Competitive salary with a discretionary bonus\n* Significant equity ownership, allowing you to share in the company's success\n* Flexible, remote\\-first work environment supporting work\\-life balance\n\n\n Equal Opportunity\n   \n\n  \n\n Cedar is an equal\\-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and applicants. We do not discriminate based on race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, veteran status, or any other protected characteristic. If you require an accommodation during any stage of the hiring process, please let us know, and we will gladly assist.",
